    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villains attack the Slime Nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush them to save it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SRUSH: 2D roguelike pull-action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull and shoot slimes with your mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash villains to defend your nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game over if they reach it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all waves to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse-only controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy Pull Action!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot slimes at enemies with your mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villains spawn each wave and approach the nest. Stop them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/b7c8858c20f8b33b5751fcb5049d83e1.poster.avif?t=1750209655\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/b7c8858c20f8b33b5751fcb5049d83e1.webm?t=1750209655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/b7c8858c20f8b33b5751fcb5049d83e1.mp4?t=1750209655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up Slimes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade stats and skills to boost slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/c6ac1e842045a05aa06d3f8755754f5f.poster.avif?t=1750209655\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/c6ac1e842045a05aa06d3f8755754f5f.webp?t=1750209655\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=270 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Builds!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strong slimes to crush enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/f9afe7a6bd757bf78085d2319ce8c68c.poster.avif?t=1750209655\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/f9afe7a6bd757bf78085d2319ce8c68c.webm?t=1750209655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/f9afe7a6bd757bf78085d2319ce8c68c.mp4?t=1750209655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endless Replay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock skills and 6 characters with 5 difficulty levels for tons of fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villains attack the Slime Nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush them to save it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SRUSH: 2D roguelike pull-action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull and shoot slimes with your mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash villains to defend your nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game over if they reach it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all waves to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse-only controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy Pull Action!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot slimes at enemies with your mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villains spawn each wave and approach the nest. Stop them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/b7c8858c20f8b33b5751fcb5049d83e1.poster.avif?t=1750209655\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/b7c8858c20f8b33b5751fcb5049d83e1.webm?t=1750209655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/b7c8858c20f8b33b5751fcb5049d83e1.mp4?t=1750209655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up Slimes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade stats and skills to boost slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/c6ac1e842045a05aa06d3f8755754f5f.poster.avif?t=1750209655\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/c6ac1e842045a05a